# ripgrep-only companion to .gitignore (precedence: .ignore > .gitignore).
# The marketing site clone is git-ignored on purpose (see .gitignore), but
# editors and agents build their @-file pickers with ripgrep, and a git-ignored
# folder vanishes from them too. Un-hide it for those tools only; git itself
# never reads this file, so the site still cannot be staged from here.
!personaljarvisweb/
